caption:
Suddenly I understand Stan a little too well “Stan” is one of Eminem’s most iconic storytelling records, released in 2000 as the third single from The Marshall Mathers LP. Built around a haunting sample from Dido’s “Thank You,” the song unfolds through a series of letters from an increasingly obsessed fan named Stan, creating a dark and cinematic narrative.

